{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JUdK5oZBsXZ7EnHo6ZQu1b","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 10\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pass 阈值统一为 ≥2pp + bootstrap CI 不含 0；补全 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: IDEA_BRIEF pilot 用 2pp（Defects4J 上下文），ROADMAP 初版用 3pp。考虑到 holdout ~1.3K\\\\n    样本统计功效有限，统一为 2pp + CI 要求。FAIL 后先排查 bug 1 天，clean fail 则 pivot 到 negative-result\\\\n    framing。WEAK PASS 追加 CRUXEval verdict 验证。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 第一轮结果无效：VOTA match 字段泄漏 + full_trace label 截断，需修复后重训\\\\n  rationale: VOTA 99.16% 来自 match=True/False 直接泄漏答案（trivial pattern matching）；full_trace\\\\n    28.4% 来自 label 被 2048 token 截断丢弃。no_trace 75.13% 有效但无法与其他条件对比。修复方案：去 match 字段\\\\n    + 智能截断保留 label。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — VOTA 95.63% (+20.5pp over no_trace), 附带 actual/expected leakage\\\\n    concern 需 ablation 验证\\\\n  rationale: D001 标准满足：VOTA vs no_trace +20.5pp, 95% CI [+17.7, +23.4] 不含 0。但 >95%\\\\n    触发高准确率警戒，pass_recall 99.8% 暗示模型可能在做 actual==expected 字符串比对而非代码行为理解。进入 research\\\\n    阶段后第一实验必须是去 actual/expected ablation。full_trace 28.49% 为 genuine negative（100%\\\\n    预测 fail，trace token 稀释分类梯度），后续可尝试 label-only loss。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 95.63% accuracy, +20.5pp lift, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: negative\\\\n    result: 28.49% accuracy, model collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D004: full_trace 28.4% 系 chat template overhead 导致 label 截断（非 genuine\\\\n    negative），选方案 B + 三条件全部重训 v5'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 诊断发现 format_training_data.py 按 raw tokens 截断到 2048，但 train_sft.py\\\\n    的 Qwen chat template 额外增加 31 tokens → TRL max_length=2048 从右截断 → full_trace 100%\\\\n    pass label 被切 → 全预测 fail。VOTA 也受影响（89.4% pass label 被截），但 360 条足够学到 95.63%。选方案\\\\n    B（根本修复：trace budget 减 32 tokens）+ 三条件全部重训，确保公平对比。这是第三轮修复，必须加 end-to-end 验证：训练前确认\\\\n    0 样本被截断。Claim 2（full traces hurt）暂时搁置，等 v5 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: 28.49% due to label truncation bug, not genuine negative\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 95.63% with only 10.6% pass labels intact — may improve after fix\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D005: full_trace_v5 确认 81.76%（非 collapse），D004 假说正确。Claim 2 从 \\\\\\\"full traces\\\\n    hurt\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"VOTA 显著优于 full_trace (+13.8pp)\\\\\\\"。plan_002 降为 P1。'\\\\n  rationale: v5 修复 chat template overhead 后 full_trace 从 28.4% 恢复到 81.76%（+6.6pp over\\\\n    no_trace），确认 v2 collapse 是截断 bug 非 gradient dilution。三条件梯度：no_trace 75.1% < full_trace\\\\n    81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。Claim 2 reframe 为 \\\\\\\"trace compression 提供更高 information density\\\\\\\"。plan_002\\\\n    (label-only loss) 原假设 (gradient dilution) 已被否定，降为 P1；plan_001 (去 actual/expected)\\\\n    仍是最高优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 81.76% accuracy, +6.6pp over no_trace, confirms D004 truncation fix\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 95.63%, +13.8pp over full_trace\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 75.13%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: full_trace collapse 根因确认为 chat template overhead bug，非 gradient dilution；v5\\\\n    修复后 accuracy 81.8%\\\\n  rationale: full_trace_v2 的 28.4% accuracy + 100% predict fail collapse 完全由 chat\\\\n    template overhead 导致 pass 样本 label 被截断造成。v5 修复截断后 accuracy 恢复至 81.8%（+6.7pp over\\\\n    no_trace），collapse 完全消除（pass_recall 从 8.5% 恢复至 87%）。三条件形成清晰层次：no_trace 75.1% <\\\\n    full_trace 81.8% < VOTA 95.6%。原 D004 中的 gradient dilution 假说被推翻。plan_002 (label-only\\\\n    loss) 仍保留为 ablation 实验但目的调整：不再验证 collapse 根因，改为测试 loss masking 对 full_trace 的边际提升。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v2\\\\n    role: 原始实验（含 bug）\\\\n    result: 28.4% accuracy, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 修复后实验\\\\n    result: 81.8% accuracy, collapse 消除\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy\\\\n  - exp_id: no_trace_seed42_v4\\\\n    role: 对比基准\\\\n    result: 75.13% accuracy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 3 从 element-level 降级为 component-level design principles；ae_only 移至\\\\n    Appendix\\\\n  rationale: ae_only 数据 88% (4159/4720) 为 fallback locals dump 而非干净 actual/expected\\\\n    值（VOTA compressor _extract_assertions() 固有行为）。ae_only 结果无论高低都无法干净归因于 actual/expected。Reviewer\\\\n    评估：三个干净实验（plan_001 减法 + exception_only + loop_only）足以支撑 component-level 归因，但不够\\\\n    element-level。采纳 Reviewer Option A：主表报告 plan_001 + exception_only + loop_only，ae_only\\\\n    移 Appendix 附 caveat。Claim 1/2 不受影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: component ablation (ae_only/exception_only/loop_only)\\\\n    result: ae_only 88% fallback 污染\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: 主线证据 (减法验证 ae 贡献)\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 确认 actual/expected 不是 VOTA 效果来源；Claim 1 走 genuine behavioral understanding\\\\n    路径\\\\n  rationale: vota_no_ae (去除 actual/expected) accuracy 99.41% vs VOTA 完整版 99.16%，差异仅\\\\n    3 样本/1190（不显著），去 ae 后不降反微升。exception + loop + assertion structure 足以实现近完美 verdict\\\\n    预测。Claim 1 contingency 中 \\\\\\\"trivial string comparison\\\\\\\" 假说被否定。Reviewer 同时指出 trace\\\\n    结构性信号（[No trace available]→fail, [ERROR]→fail, [ASSERT]+[LOOP]→pass）可能构成 trivial\\\\n    pattern，但此问题对所有 VOTA 变体等同存在，不影响 plan_001 结论。exception_only ablation (plan_003\\\\n    sub-b) 将量化 [ERROR] 信号贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_no_ae_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_001 ablation\\\\n    result: 99.41% accuracy, 7 errors/1190\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照基准\\\\n    result: 99.16% accuracy, 10 errors/1190\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_002 确认 gradient dilution 是 real 但 minor factor (4.5pp/17.4pp=26%)；information\\\\n    overload 是 VOTA 优势主因 (74%)\\\\n  rationale: full_trace label-only loss 86.2% vs 标准 loss 81.8%，提升 4.5pp 确认 gradient\\\\n    dilution 存在。但 86.2% vs VOTA 99.2% 仍有 13pp gap，只能通过 trace compression 弥补。因果分解：gradient\\\\n    dilution 贡献 ~26% (4.5/17.4pp)，information overload 贡献 ~74% (13.0/17.4pp)。VOTA\\\\n    的核心优势是信息质量（decision-relevant state selection），不仅是训练效率。这为 Claim 2 提供了定量支撑，可在论文中写\\\\\\\"Even\\\\n    with oracle loss masking, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_label_only_seed42\\\\n    role: plan_002 ablation\\\\n    result: 86.2% accuracy [84.4, 88.1]\\\\n  - exp_id: full_trace_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (standard loss)\\\\n    result: 81.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: vota_seed42_v5\\\\n    role: 对照 (VOTA)\\\\n    result: 99.2%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6667, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EX6wbN8zhGs14GM5S4WH5F","session_id":"92dde915-20d3-4721-be88-dcd90139ca96","uuid":"e0ba97cc-fec8-4c22-ba33-4d8f3fb65d96","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:28:18.442Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0116EUPYPv4pXAaG2ykij3T8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BkRfZdfN53MtMdBh5S49z1","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"trace-verdict-study","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8908,"cache_read_input_tokens":19715,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8908,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":52,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EX6wbN8zhGs14GM5S4WH5F","session_id":"92dde915-20d3-4721-be88-dcd90139ca96","uuid":"d587b724-9847-4ed1-9ad6-0bbe07149fb5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkRfZdfN53MtMdBh5S49z1","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — trace-verdict-study\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission)\\\\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\\\\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026 (10 days from today)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Insight\\\\n\\\\nTrace SFT effectiveness depends critically on **trace granularity matching task output entropy**: verdict tasks (1-bit output) benefit from execution traces, but compact, decision-relevant abstractions (VOTA: 99.2%) dramatically outperform full traces (81.8%). The performance gradient no_trace (75.1%) < full_trace (81.8%) < VOTA (99.2%) shows that the \\\\\\\"right\\\\\\\" trace is not \\\\\\\"more trace\\\\\\\" — it's the minimal information sufficient to determine the verdict, providing higher information density per token. All conditions verified on v5 codebase with consistent eval pipeline.\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (≤3)\\\\n\\\\n1. **VOTA dramatically improves verdict prediction**: Verdict-Optimized Trace Abstraction provides +24.0pp accuracy improvement over no-trace baseline (99.2% vs 75.1%) for test outcome prediction, 95% CI [+21.9, +26.8] excluding zero. Plan_001 confirms this is genuine behavioral understanding, not trivial actual/expected string comparison (vota_no_ae: 99.4%).\\\\n\\\\n2. **Trace compression significantly improves verdict accuracy over full traces**: Full execution traces achieve 81.8% (+6.6pp, CI [+4.4, +9.0]), but VOTA achieves 99.2% (+24.0pp) — a +17.4pp advantage. Plan_002 (label-only loss) 量化因果分解：gradient dilution 贡献 ~26% of gap (4.5pp, 修复后 full_trace 86.2%), information overload 贡献 ~74% (13.0pp, 只有 trace compression 能解决)。\\\\\\\"Even with oracle loss masking that eliminates gradient dilution, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp, confirming that information density — not training signal distribution — is the primary bottleneck.\\\\\\\" 所有条件基于 v5 代码版本公平对比。\\\\n\\\\n3. **Information granularity, not information presence, determines trace SFT value**: Through systematic ablation — removing assertion-point information from VOTA (plan_001 减法) and isolating exception/loop components individually — we establish a **component importance hierarchy** for verdict-optimized trace design, providing empirical design principles at the compression-component level. [注：ae_only 88% fallback 污染，不支撑 element-level 归因。ae_only 结果移至 Appendix 附 caveat；主线证据为 plan_001 减法 + exception_only + loop_only 三角验证。]\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n\\\\n- **Problem**: Existing trace SFT studies (DCSH, TracePile) evaluate only generative tasks and find limited benefit. No prior work has tested trace SFT on code behavior verdict tasks (binary pass/fail), nor designed trace representations specifically for classification.\\\\n\\\\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: DCSH (EMNLP Findings 2025) tested 5 trace formats on generation tasks, finding limited benefit. TracePile (NeurIPS 2025) scaled to 2.6M samples but only evaluated generation. TRACED (ICSE 2024) showed traces help encoder-based classification, but nobody has tested decoder SFT. All existing trace formats are designed for full execution simulation, not classification.\\\\n\\\\n- **Our framing**: We ask \\\\\\\"does trace granularity need to match task complexity?\\\\\\\" and demonstrate that verdict tasks — with O(1) output entropy — benefit from a fundamentally different trace design principle than generation tasks. VOTA captures only decision-relevant execution states (assertion snapshots, exception summaries) rather than full simulation.\\\\n\\\\n- **Headline result template**: \\\\\\\"On test verdict prediction, VOTA-SFT achieves 99.2% (+24.0pp over baseline), outperforming both no-trace (75.1%) and full-trace SFT (81.8%) — a clear performance gradient demonstrating that decision-relevant trace compression, not more trace information, maximizes SFT effectiveness for classification.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Venue Fit Risks\\\\n\\\\n- EMNLP主会 vs SE: 论文核心贡献是对 trace SFT 的 task-dependent 效果的系统性实证发现 + 新 trace representation，属于 NLP for code 方向。投 EMNLP Code track 合适。\\\\n- 单任务风险: 目前只在 test verdict prediction 一个任务上验证。需要至少加一个 verdict task（patch correctness 或 bug detection）才够 EMNLP Main。Findings 可能只需当前结果 + ablation。\\\\n- Leakage concern: 如果 ablation 证明 VOTA 效果主要来自 actual==expected 字符串比对，claim 需要调整为 \\\\\\\"verdict tasks 需要的不是 trace reasoning 而是 decision-relevant data points\\\\\\\"——仍然 publishable 但 framing 不同。\\\\n\\\\n## Contingency Framing\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 1 contingency — RESOLVED (D008)\\\\n\\\\n**实际结果**: vota_no_ae accuracy 99.41% vs VOTA 完整版 99.16%（差异 3 样本/1190，不显著）。去除 actual/expected 后准确率不降反微升。\\\\n\\\\n**生效 framing**: \\\\\\\"genuine behavioral understanding\\\\\\\" — VOTA 的效果来自 exception + loop + assertion 结构性信息，不依赖 actual/expected 字符串比对。VOTA teaches execution-grounded verdict reasoning。\\\\n\\\\n**残余问题**: trace 结构性信号（[No trace available]→fail, [ERROR]→fail, [ASSERT]+[LOOP]→pass）可能构成 trivial pattern。此问题对所有 VOTA 变体等同存在。plan_003 exception_only ablation 将量化 [ERROR] 信号贡献。需在论文 Discussion 中诚实讨论。\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 2 contingency — RESOLVED (D006 + D009)\\\\n\\\\n**实际结果**: v5 full_trace 81.8%（collapse 为 bug, D006）。plan_002 label-only loss 86.2%，量化 gradient dilution 为 minor factor：4.5pp/17.4pp = 26% (D009)。\\\\n\\\\n**生效 framing**: \\\\\\\"Both trace types help verdict tasks, but VOTA's advantage is primarily information quality (74% of gap), not training signal distribution (26%). Even with oracle loss masking that eliminates gradient dilution, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp — trace compression is not just cost-saving but accuracy-improving through higher information density per token.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Key Open Questions (Post-MVP)\\\\n\\\\n1. ~~actual/expected ablation~~ (已解决: D008, genuine behavioral understanding 路径确认)\\\\n2. ~~full_trace collapse~~ (已解决: chat template bug, D006) → plan_002 改为 ablation: label-only loss 能否进一步提升 full_trace 81.8%?\\\\n3. 能否在第二个 verdict task 上复现？→ 决定 generalization claim\\\\n4. 需要多模型验证吗？→ 时间允许就加 DeepSeek-Coder\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n\\\\n| Concern | Planned Response |\\\\n|---------|-----------------|\\\\n| \\\\\\\"VOTA 99.2% 可能是 trivial actual==expected 比对\\\\\\\" | plan_001 已否定：去 ae 后 99.41%，不降反升。VOTA 效果来自 exception/loop/assertion 结构 |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"VOTA 高 accuracy 可能来自 trace 结构性信号（error 有无、trace 有无）而非深层理解\\\\\\\" | plan_003 exception_only 将量化 [ERROR] 信号贡献；Discussion 中诚实讨论结构性信号角色；full_trace 也有这些信号但仅 81.8%，说明结构性信号不是全部 |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"只在一个任务/数据集上测试\\\\\\\" | 加 patch correctness task 或 CRUXEval verdict variant |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"只用一个模型\\\\\\\" | 加 DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B 复现（DCSH 同模型） |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"full_trace collapse 可能是实现 bug\\\\\\\" | 诚实披露：v2 collapse 确为 chat template bug；v5 修复后 full_trace 81.8%，三条件层次清晰。论文报告 v5 结果，Appendix 记录 bug 发现过程作为方法论透明性 |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"VOTA 只是 feature engineering 不是方法创新\\\\\\\" | 定位为 empirical contribution: 系统性发现 + design principles + task-spectrum analysis |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"与 DCSH 的关系不清\\\\\\\" | 明确：我们 complement DCSH（他们做 generation，我们做 classification） |\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6467, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EX6wbN8zhGs14GM5S4WH5F","session_id":"92dde915-20d3-4721-be88-dcd90139ca96","uuid":"c9ee5b5a-a459-4c2f-bb1f-bc69b2b59d24","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:28:21.751Z"}
