{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019QN2WXdrtkQoKHFNDcZc2J","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 trace-verdict-study 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (19 个)\\n\\n- **no_trace_seed42_v5**: DONE (success) — \\n- **vota_no_ae_seed42**: DONE (success) — \\n- **full_trace_seed42_v5**: DONE (success) — \\n- **vota_ae_only_seed42**: PREPARING — \\n- **vota_seed42_v5**: DONE (success) — \\n- **vota_seed42_v4**: DONE (success) — \\n- **full_trace_seed42_v2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **no_trace_seed42_v4**: DONE (success) — \\n- **full_trace_seed42**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **no_trace_seed42_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **vota_seed42_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **vota_seed42_v2**: QUEUED (killed) — \\n- **vota_seed42**: QUEUED (killed) — \\n- **no_trace_seed42_v2**: QUEUED (killed) — \\n- **no_trace_seed42**: QUEUED (killed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| vota_exception_only_seed42_v2 | VOTA component ablation: exception_only condition — retry with --gradient_checkpointing (v1 OOM at step 8). Tests if [ERROR] events are the primary driver of VOTA's 99.2% accuracy (plan_003 sub-b) | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- vota_seed42_v2（排队等待 GPU）\\n- vota_seed42（排队等待 GPU）\\n- no_trace_seed42_v2（排队等待 GPU）\\n- no_trace_seed42（排队等待 GPU）\\n- vota_loop_only_seed42: VOTA component ablation: loop_only condition — only loop compression summaries, no actual/expected or exception. Tests loop behavioral pattern contribution (plan_003 sub-c)（准备中）\\n- vota_ae_only_seed42: VOTA component ablation: ae_only condition — only actual/expected values, no exception/loop compression (plan_003 sub-a)（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **full_trace_label_only_seed42** (success): Label-only loss on full_trace fixes gradient dilution collapse (plan_002: loss only on pass/fail token, not trace tokens)\\n- **vota_exception_only_seed42** (failed): VOTA component ablation: exception_only condition — only exception summaries, no actual/expected or loop compression. Tests if [ERROR] events are the primary driver of VOTA's 99.2% accuracy (plan_003 sub-b)\\n- **no_trace_seed42_v5** (success): Baseline: verdict accuracy without execution trace (v5: same code version as vota_v5/full_trace_v5 for fair comparison)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 7 / 负向 1 / 失败 1 / 共 12\\naccuracy: 0.8622 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\naccuracy_ci_lower: 0.8437 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-11235: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- no_trace_seed42_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- vota_seed42_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- full_trace_seed42: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- vota_exception_only_seed42: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_014jFeVpqD4HKUojyTkTcMW7","session_id":"92dde915-20d3-4721-be88-dcd90139ca96","uuid":"dc976505-1246-4baf-882e-61b2f15c4eb3","timestamp":"2026-05-15T09:28:35.230Z"}
